msgctxt "92"
msgid "Try this, Miki-chan! You'll love it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"And try this Ryukyu pork! Have some snacks while you can⑬if Nakahara-san "
"were here, you wouldn't get a single bite!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Thanks a bunch! Keeping an eye on things here sure is hungry work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "I don't know, it looks like you've done more eating than patrolling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"No, I'm just touching base with everybody. This kind of communication is "
"real important here in Okinawa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Uh-huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Miki-chan! Got some gorgeous fresh mangoes for you! Come and get 'em!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Ooh! Guess I've got a little more patrolling to do then, huh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Seriously?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Oh, and sir? If you wouldn't mind keepin' this a secret from the boss..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "(Mikio's too busy eating everything we pass to actually do work.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"(I guess the yakuza do things differently here. This would never fly in "
"Kamurocho, that's for sure.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Eeek!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "What was that?"
msgstr ""

